<h2 id="trazabilidad" class="rojo">11. 🔧 TRAZABILIDAD Y COMANDOS ADMIN</h2>

<h3>11.1 Verificar estado del VPS</h3>
<pre><span class="c-comentario"># Desde el workspace</span>
<span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'uptime && free -h | head -2 && df -h / | tail -1'

<span class="c-comentario"># Estado de procesos en pausa</span>
<span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'ps -eo pid,stat,comm | grep "T "'

<span class="c-comentario"># Ver logs del orquestador</span>
<span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'tail -50 /tmp/orq.log'

<span class="c-comentario"># Ver logs de cloudflare</span>
<span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'tail -10 /tmp/cf.log'</pre>

<h3>11.2 Resumir un proceso pausado (SIGCONT)</h3>
<pre><span class="c-comentario"># Reanudar todos los procesos en T</span>
<span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'for p in $(ps -eo pid,stat | awk "\$2 ~ /T/ {print \$1}"); do kill -CONT $p; done'

<span class="c-comentario"># Reanudar uno específico (ej. openclaw)</span>
<span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'kill -CONT 2138546'</pre>

<h3>11.3 Reiniciar el orquestador</h3>
<pre><span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'pkill -9 -f conector_chat; sleep 2; cd /opt/orquestador-universal && (setsid nohup bash -c "source .env && python3 -m orchestrator.conector_chat --port 9090 --host 0.0.0.0" < /dev/null > /tmp/orq.log 2>&1 &)'</pre>

<h3>11.4 Reiniciar Cloudflare Tunnel</h3>
<pre><span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'pkill -9 -f cloudflared; sleep 2; (setsid nohup cloudflared tunnel --url http://127.0.0.1:9090 --no-autoupdate < /dev/null > /tmp/cf.log 2>&1 &); sleep 10; grep -oE "https://[a-z-]+\.trycloudflare\.com" /tmp/cf.log | tail -1'</pre>

<h3>11.5 Desbanear IP de fail2ban</h3>
<pre><span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'fail2ban-client set sshd unbanip TU_IP'</pre>

<h3>11.6 Configurar SSH key-based (recomendado)</h3>
<pre><span class="c-comentario"># 1. Generar key en tu máquina local</span>
ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/vps_orquestador

<span class="c-comentario"># 2. Copiar al VPS (reemplaza TU_KEY)</span>
ssh-copy-id -i ~/.ssh/vps_orquestador.pub root@95.111.232.89

<span class="c-comentario"># 3. Conectar sin password</span>
ssh -i ~/.ssh/vps_orquestador root@95.111.232.89

<span class="c-comentario"># 4. Deshabilitar password auth (más seguro)</span>
ssh root@95.111.232.89 'sed -i "s/^#PasswordAuthentication yes/PasswordAuthentication no/" /etc/ssh/sshd_config && systemctl reload sshd'</pre>

<h3>11.7 Agregar swap al VPS (para evitar OOM)</h3>
<pre><span class="c-azul">ssh</span> root@95.111.232.89 'fallocate -l 4G /swapfile && chmod 600 /swapfile && mkswap /swapfile && swapon /swapfile && echo "/swapfile none swap sw 0 0" >> /etc/fstab && free -h | head -2'</pre>

